{
 "out": "/tmp/photonz-playtest/transform-values-link-walk",
 "seed": "Width and height in the transform values keep their proportion, at Next defaults with no flag changed. The recording is picked and Info opened from the tool bar: W 1280 and H 800 are joined by a link, on by default. 640 typed into W brings H to 400 in one undo step, which Command Z takes back whole; 400 typed into H brings W to 640. One click on the link turns it off, and 500 typed into W then leaves H at 400. A second click turns it back on.",
 "setup": {
  "forget": [
   "all"
  ],
  "timelineOpen": true
 },
